This directory vendors the scanner portion of gopkg.in/yaml.v3 v3.0.1
(scannerc.go, yamlh.go, readerc.go, apic.go, yamlprivateh.go), which is
itself derived from libyaml. Unused emitter and event API surface was
removed, and two deliberate behavioural deviations restore pyyaml's token
mark placement (BLOCK-END marks, no forced newline at stream end); both are
marked with [astl] comments in the source. See LICENSE in this directory and
docs/adr/0005-yamllint-port-and-scanner-vendoring.md.
